# Financial Intelligence OS (FIOS) Builder

## Overview

The FIOS Builder is the engineering platform responsible for designing, generating, validating, monitoring, automating, and integrating the Financial Intelligence OS repository.

The Builder provides the tooling, standards, workflows, templates, automation, and release pipeline used to create and maintain the project in a structured, repeatable, and production-ready manner.

